   "title": "gmlx nodes: install",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "These gmlx nodes run the image model on a gmlx server on your Mac (Apple Silicon, M3 or newer). MiniMax-H3-Image needs ComfyUI 0.45 or newer. The workflow makes a 4096x4096 image, 16 megapixels, in 6 steps at cfg 1. It has four times the pixels of the 2048x2048 workflow, and each step takes more than four times as long. On a Mac without the memory for it, the server refuses the size and names the largest it fits. For an edit from up to 16 pictures, open minimax-h3-image-edit-two-references. Read the model's license before you use the images: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/images.html#licenses\n\n1. Install gmlx: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/installation.html\n2. Put the nodes into ComfyUI, then restart ComfyUI:\n\n   gmlx comfyui install\n\n3. Download the model:\n\n   gmlx pull minimax-h3-image\n\nGuide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/comfyui.html"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
